      "text": {
        "en": "Many clients express deep gratitude for the empathy shown by attending veterinarians, particularly during difficult end-of-life visits. Several pet parents praise caring doctors and helpful desk assistants. Conversely, other reviewers criticize select technicians and receptionists for unprofessional remarks and perceived indifference."
      }
    },
