      "title": {
        "en": "Concerns over high medical fees"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Veterinary costs and billing policies draw substantial criticism from local pet owners. Reviewers describe steep treatment estimates, unexpected diagnostic add-on charges, and expensive surgery quotes. Several clients express frustration with strict in-person payment rules and suggest that fee transparency could be significantly improved."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "results",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
