      "title": {
        "en": "Mixed evaluations of medical treatments"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Client accounts regarding medical outcomes at the facility show divergent experiences. While several pet owners report effective diagnostics, successful routine treatments, and helpful care for cats, others express dissatisfaction with allergy therapies and question treatment recommendations for serious illnesses."
      }
    }
